# WN22-00-000330: Windows Server 2022 must not have the Microsoft FTP service installed unless required by the organization.
# Source: Windows Server 2022 STIG r8
# Severity: medium
# Generated from 01-extract/output/windows-server-2022-stig-r8-controls.json

META
    esp_id `win2022-wn22-00-000330-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `high`

    title `Windows Server 2022 must not have the Microsoft FTP service installed unless required by the organization.`
    description `Unnecessary services increase the attack surface of a system. Some of these services may not support required levels of authentication or encryption.`
    author `scanset-security`
    tags `windows,server-2022,stig,windows-feature,medium,ksi-cmt-rmv,ksi-iam-jit`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-CMT-RMV,KSI:KSI-IAM-JIT,NIST-800-53:CM-7`
    control_objective `KSI-CMT-RMV,KSI-IAM-JIT`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Windows:server-2022:endpoint`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Uninstall the "FTP Server" role. Start "Server Manager". Select the server with the role. Scroll down to "ROLES AND FEATURES" in the right pane. Select "Remove Roles and Features" from the drop-down "TASKS" list. Select the appropriate server on the "Server Selection" page and click "Next". Deselect "FTP Server" under "Web Server (IIS)" on the "Roles" page. Click "Next" and "Remove" as prompted.`

    component_id `comp-windows-feature`

    impl_KSI_CMT_RMV `Windows Server implements KSI-CMT-RMV by keeping the 'Web-Ftp-Service' Windows Server feature/role uninstalled. The ESP scanner queries the feature via the windows_feature CTN (Get-WindowsFeature) and fails the policy if the feature is Installed. Remediation uninstalls the feature via Uninstall-WindowsFeature or Server Manager.`
    impl_KSI_IAM_JIT `Windows Server implements KSI-IAM-JIT by keeping the 'Web-Ftp-Service' Windows Server feature/role uninstalled. The ESP scanner queries the feature via the windows_feature CTN (Get-WindowsFeature) and fails the policy if the feature is Installed. Remediation uninstalls the feature via Uninstall-WindowsFeature or Server Manager.`
    impl_CM_7 `Windows Server implements CM-7 by keeping the 'Web-Ftp-Service' Windows Server feature/role uninstalled. The ESP scanner queries the feature via the windows_feature CTN (Get-WindowsFeature) and fails the policy if the feature is Installed. Remediation uninstalls the feature via Uninstall-WindowsFeature or Server Manager.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        name `Web-Ftp-Service`
        behavior executor windowsfeature
    OBJECT_END

    STATE compliant
        enabled boolean = false
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN windows_feature
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
